        "original_id": "3ef36a9f-8724-5488-9a30-0233f22b493f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garrett Morris, Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, Karen Maruyama\n- Products: Saturday Night Live, Martin, The Jamie Foxx Show, Strip Mall, Suddenly Susan, Arrested Development\n- Roles: Stan Winters\n- Companies: Fox\n\nFacts:\n- Garrett Morris was born on February 1, 1937, and is an American comedian and actor.\n- Garrett Morris was part of the original cast of Saturday Night Live and appeared on the sketch comedy program from 1975 to 1980.\n- Martin is an American sitcom that aired for five seasons on Fox from August 27, 1992 to May 1, 1997.\n- Garrett Morris played Stan Winters on the sitcom Martin from 1992 to 1995.\n- The Jamie Foxx Show stars Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, and Garrett Morris.\n- Karen Maruyama appeared on television in supporting roles, including recurring characters on The Jamie Foxx Show, Strip Mall, Suddenly Susan, and Arrested Development.",
